# Slash command authoring

When creating or editing `.cursor/commands/*.md`:

1. Use **write-cursor-commands** skill.
2. Filename = `/command` name (kebab-case, no README.md here).
3. Structure: `#` title, imperative **Steps**, clear **Output**.
4. Update `.cursor/docs/USER-MANUAL.md` command table for new project commands.
